The map f is explicitly constructible for any gb parameters.
gamma_gb = delta_f is verified for the sample pair (H2, E_epd1).
By H^2(C(n+1); C(n+1)) = 0 (Whitehead lemma for basic classical simple LSA),
ALL inhomogeneous deformations gamma_gb are trivial for any gb in C^{4n}.
Triviality condition: ALWAYS SATISFIED (no restriction on gb).

